NJOY2016
--------

Source: https://github.com/njoy/NJOY2016 (version 2016.80)

kika/processing/_thermal_native.c is derived from NJOY2016: THERMR (calcem, sigl,
sig, terpq in thermr.f90), sigfig (util.f90) and ACER's thermal table thinning
(acesix in aceth.f90). It is modified software: it is a C translation, it adds a
closed-form free-gas integration that is not NJOY's, and it continues where THERMR
stops with an error. It is not the version of NJOY2016 available from LANL.

Other modules of kika.processing reimplement methods of NJOY2016 modules (HEATR,
PURR, ACER) and cite the routines they follow. This notice covers them as well.

